@startuml flow-contribution-v1
!theme cerulean-outline
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1117
skinparam defaultFontColor #C9D1D9
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #58A6FF
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #161B22
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #30363D
skinparam ActivityFontColor #C9D1D9
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #1C2A3A
skinparam NoteBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam NoteFontColor #93C5FD

title <color:#58A6FF><b>BY-SYSTEMS — Contribution Flow</b></color>\n<color:#8B949E>ADR-0006 · Layer-gated · RAID-tracked</color>

start

:Read **ADR-0006** — Platform Charter;
note right: doc-platform-core/docs/adr/0006-platform-charter.md

:Read repo **CLAUDE.md** + **AGENTS.md**;

:Check current **Layer** (ADR-0006 §1);

if (Correct layer ready?) then (no)
  :Stop — finish current layer first;
  note right: <color:#F59E0B>Layer gates are non-negotiable</color>
  stop
else (yes)
endif

:Check open RAID items in platform-setup GitHub Issues;

:Create branch\n**feature/{issue-id}-{short-desc}**;

partition "Development" {
  :Make changes;
  :Write / update tests;
  :Run linting + tests locally;
  :Update docs if needed;
}

if (New finding / risk / gap?) then (yes)
  :RAID.md entry\n+ GitHub Issue (raid:* label)\n+ Projects board;
  note right: <color:#F59E0B>All three. Atomic.</color>
else (no)
endif

if (Architecture decision?) then (yes)
  :New ADR in\ndoc-platform-core/docs/adr/;
else (no)
endif

:Commit — **conventional commit**\n//type(scope): subject//;

:Open PR → dev branch;

:Rune reviews\nPosts diagram to Discord #bot-openclaw;

:yboujraf approves;

:Merge → dev → main;

:Tag with **semantic version**\n//vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH//;

:CHANGELOG updated;

stop

@enduml
